<http://data.silknow.org/object/5599d878-353a-306d-bfe8-bee85fcfd827/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Woven silk scarf, shaded in broad stripes from white to deep lilac. In the darker part are narrow pattern warp stripes of 'shawl' motifs, in green on shaded blue and white silk, bound in two twills. At either end of the shawl, the striped pattern is changed to check by the addition of black bands. Superimposed on these, between the stripes, are brocaded 'cones' in white. A shaded fringe of green, blue, white and lilac is knotted in silk at either end."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/5599d878-353a-306d-bfe8-bee85fcfd827> .

